Package: openmediavault-aaos
Architecture: all
Depends: openmediavault (>= 8.3)
Description: openmediavault AAOS plugin
 Bridges OMV JSON-RPC to AAOS Core (AI Agents Operating System).
 Exposes 'AAOS' RPC service with query/status methods that proxy to
 /run/aaos/core.sock. Natural-language NAS management via OMV.
